{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2021-04-15 10:00:00', 'title': 'AMEREN EARNS 2021 GREAT PLACE TO WORK CERTIFICATION™', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, APRIL 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOR THE FIFTH YEAR IN A ROW, AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE) HAS BEEN CERTIFIED™ BY GREAT PLACE TO WORK®. THE PRESTIGIOUS AWARD IS BASED ENTIRELY ON WHAT CURRENT EMPLOYEES SAY ABOUT THEIR EXPERIENCE WORKING AT AMEREN.'}